OL,3,AWorld leaders congratulate Lula after
OL,4,ABrazil election win as rival Flavio
OL,5,ABolsonaro refuses to concede
OL,6,
OL,7,FWorld leaders have been congratulating
OL,8,FBrazil's left-wing President Lula after
OL,9,Fhe won a fourth term in office,
OL,10,Fdefeating right-wing challenger Flavio
OL,11,FBolsonaro - here's how he did it
OL,13,FBut the 80-year-old, who took just
OL,14,Funder 52% in the run-off vote, now
OL,15,Ffaces a hostile Congress and divided
OL,16,Fcountry
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
