OL,3,AWorld leaders congratulate Lula after
OL,4,ABrazil election win as rival Flavio
OL,5,ABolsonaro refuses to concede
OL,6,
OL,7,FBolsonaro - who won the first round -
OL,8,Fsays the result is "inexplicable" and
OL,9,Fcalls for it to be annulled, a
OL,10,Fsupporter says he was "more than
OL,11,Fupset". Our Latin America editor
OL,12,Fexplains what's happening
OL,14,FHis father, ex-president Jair
OL,15,FBolsonaro, is currently serving a jail
OL,16,Fsentence under house arrest for
OL,17,Fplotting a coup after losing the last
OL,18,Felection
